    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebirkukwata aha by'ikwija kwa Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo n'okuteerana kwaitu okumubugana, nitubeeshengyereza, B'eishe-emwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mutarahuka kuhahaaza emitima mukabura obwengye, mutajagarazibwa yaaba mwoyo nari ekigambo nari ebaruha, ei barikugira ngu ekahandiikwa itwe, ebirikuranga ngu ekiro kya Mukama kiiriire haihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.2.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Yoh 2:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hatagira omuntu owaababeihabeiha omu muringo gwona; ahakuba ekiro ekyo tikiriija, hatakabandize kubaho okutaana na Ruhanga, omuntu ogwo omugomi akashuuruurwa, niwe mwana w'okuhwerekyerera, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.28.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 28:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kandi omuzigu oyetunguura, akarwanisa ekintu kyona ekyetwa Ruhanga nari ekiramibwa, akashutama omuri hekalu ya Ruhanga, naayeyeta Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timurikwijuka ku naabagambiire ebyo, nkiri owaanyu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nimumanya ekirikumuzibira hati n'eki, ngu arekye kushuuruurwa obunaku bwe butakahikire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahakuba enaama y'obugomi na mbwenu etandikire kukora; kwonka orikuzibira hati naija kugumizamu okuhitsya obu ariihwaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.19.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kush 19:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.19.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Obwo, omugomi ogwo aryashuuruurwa, kandi Mukama waitu Yesu araymwitsa orwoya rw'omu kanwa ke, amuhwerekyereze n'okumurinkana kw'ekitiinisa ky'okwija kwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.24.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 24:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omugomi ogwo oriija ahabw'amaani ga Sitaane, aryaija n'obushoboorozi bwona, n'obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza by'ebishuba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'obugobya bwona obubi obw'okuhabya ab'okuhwerekyerera, ahabw'okuba bakanga kukunda amazima ngu bajumwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TI.4.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tim 4:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nikyo Ruhanga arikubooherereza ekirikuhabya eky'amaani kubaikiririsa eby'ebishuba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngu boona abatarikiriize mazima, bakashemerererwa okutahikiirira, basingwe orubanja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
